# Deny-first. This repo tracks the POLICY SURFACE only — the files that govern how
# sessions behave — so that Codex dispatches into ~/.claude produce a real diff the
# vadi can review. Everything else here is state, cache, secrets, or 1.1GB of
# transcripts, and none of it belongs in version control.
#
# Adding a new tracked path means adding an explicit `!` line below. The default is NO.

/*

!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json
!agents/
!workflows/
!output-styles/
!conventions/
!*.haoshoku-first-capture

# Belt and braces: never track credentials even if a rule above widens by accident.
.credentials.json
*.pem
*.key
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*credential*
**/*secret*
